meta {
  name: Set Default Locale
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.LocaleService/SetDefaultLocale
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept-Language: en
}

body:json {
  {
    "localeId": "{{localeId}}"
  }
}

docs {
  # Set Default Locale

  Sets a specific locale as the default locale for the system.

  ## Request
  - `localeId` (required): The UUID of the locale to set as default

  ## Behavior
  - All other locales will have their `isDefault` flag set to false
  - Only one locale can be the default at any time

  ## Response
  Returns the locale that is now set as default.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "locale": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "code": "en",
      "name": "English",
      "names": {
        "en": "English",
        "de": "Englisch",
        "fr": "Anglais"
      },
      "isDefault": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-27T18:12:31+01:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-27T18:15:42+01:00"
    }
  }
  ```

  **Note**: The `name` field is localized based on `Accept-Language` header.

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: locale id is required
  - `NOT_FOUND`: locale not found
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to set default locale
}
